etracer does render a useful display with the nouveau xorg driver. While the
title and options screen renders successful, the main game remains at a solid
blue screen, or at best, colored/shaded lines drawn from the top-left of the
screen. The game is not playable.

The hardware is an old Geforce FX5200 card, in an old Pentium-4 system.

